WEBVTT

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:03.760
The Saints...

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.070
Each with their own Guardian Constellation sign,

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:11.150
their duty is to help Athena
protect peace on Earth.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.630
By royal command from the Sanctuary,

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:50.530
the Silver Saints are the front line troops,
sent to meet the enemy.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:57.050
Their specialized combat skills are said to be
almost on par with those of the Gold Saints.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:04.350
<i>Phantom Arrow!</i>

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:15.310
You won't get away!

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:18.200
Stop! Let's follow him.

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:47.780
To flee from the Saints...

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.270
Be ashamed of yourself.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:07.700
From your reconnaissance mission,
only three of you survived.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:13.210
You did well to return, Silver Saints.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.110
This is our report.

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:23.590
Intelligence that the Specters
now gather in Italy was correct.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:26.760
Many mysterious deaths have occurred in the area,

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.730
and the citizens are filled with fear.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.050
While searching the forest,

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:34.860
we found a suspicious-looking cathedral,

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.970
and we then engaged the Specters in combat.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:41.450
We were able to terminate all of them.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:43.530
All of them?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.780
Yes. All of them...

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.830
Die!

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.830
Athena!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:54.920
<i>Ripping Saucer!</i>

00:03:55.340 --> 00:03:57.840
<i>Phantom Arrow!</i>

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.240
Have you gone mad,

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:01.300
you bastards?

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:08.060
This power... It isn't the Silver Saints'.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:11.430
Why are you this strong?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:23.860
N-No... The Silver Cloths are
shining like Underworld stones.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:27.240
It's as if they're Surplices.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.650
Yes.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:34.870
We are no longer Saints of Athena.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.810
We are not even alive.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:44.630
We were killed by the Specters
and resurrected on this Earth by Lord Hades.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:50.100
That proud Saints of Athena should fall
so low as to become Hades's troops...

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:54.520
Lord Hades saved us.

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:59.560
We are saved from ever having to fear death.

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:01.900
In exchange for

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.690
Athena's head!

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:11.330
<i>Athena...</i>

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.040
<i>Athena...</i>

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.540
<i>We...</i>

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.830
It must be done.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.880
Let's go, Shion!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.500
Dohko! Shion! Wait!

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.470
<i>We wanted...</i>

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:29.390
<i>Stardust Revolution!</i>

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:32.810
<i>Lushan One Hundred Dragons Attack!</i>

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.310
Cerberus!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.240
Auriga!

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.860
Sagitta!

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:42.510
Athena...

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:55.290
I felt your Cosmo.
When you died and became pawns...

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:58.290
You must have suffered so.

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.390
Athena...

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:03.000
We really wanted to...

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:05.380
To fight with you.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.930
To fight on your side...

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:23.830
Athena.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:24.890
Pope.

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:27.990
Please give us the order to set out for battle.

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:32.240
Please allow us to make up for

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.200
having been forced to hurt our brothers.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.850
Permission granted, Dohko, Shion.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:43.160
Select a number of Bronze
and Silver Saints and fly to Italy.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.710
Head for the town with the forest cathedral

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.600
of which Cerberus and the others spoke.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:53.040
King Hades must be there.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.390
Have caution.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.350
Huh?

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.640
The forest with the cathedral?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:04.190
Yes. We set out for Italy and
are urgently assessing the situation.

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:07.140
<i>Could it be our hometown?</i>

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:09.400
What does... What does Sasha say?

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:11.250
You mean "Lady Athena."

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:15.180
Athena prays for our safety above all else.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.620
This mission is to collect information
on Hades's movement, nothing more.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.750
Don't die! Remember that.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.840
Especially Yato.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:30.420
You've only just become a Saint.
Don't push yourself.

00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:32.680
Yes.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.970
<i>They must be joking. I'm an afterthought!</i>

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:42.300
<i>I will use the Unicorn Cloth
I worked so hard to earn,</i>

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:44.260
<i>and I will protect Lady Athena!</i>

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:47.440
<i>And I must do better than Tenma.</i>

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:04.920
<i>There's no way Sasha isn't worried about our hometown or Alone.</i>

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:14.090
<i>Don't worry, Sasha. I'll protect Alone.</i>

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.190
<i>I've seen this place before!</i>

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:30.150
<i>So Hades has returned in our hometown?</i>

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.400
<i>Is he safe? Alone...</i>

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:40.080
What's with that light?

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.910
<i>It's coming from the direction of town.</i>

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:42.700
Alone!

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:46.350
Wait, Tenma! Don't go off on your own.

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.380
It's okay.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.030
Let us go, as well.

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:50.210
Yeah.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.550
<i>So it was his hometown, after all.</i>

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.800
<i>Don't rush, Tenma!</i>

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.500
<i>He's okay. He has to be alive!</i>

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.110
Alone! Everyone!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:21.080
<i>Alone and all the townspeople...</i>

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:25.500
<i>No matter what happens,
I'll save you all, again and again!</i>

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:26.670
<i>So...</i>

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:44.430
So they've finally come... Athena's Saints.

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.980
I am Heavenly Crime Star, Lycaon Phlegyas!

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:56.960
To celebrate the return of Lord Hades,
I'll have a little bloodbath!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.110
Take this!

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:03.580
<i>Howling Inferno!</i>

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:07.040
Wh-What?!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.540
You're just a boy, a Bronze Saint.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.170
And you absorbed my Howling Inferno?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:17.420
I don't care if you're Hades or whatever, but...

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:22.250
But I've never been so angry in my life!

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:26.770
Whoa... What is this Cosmo?

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.080
<i>Pegasus...</i>

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.440
<i>Meteor Fist!</i>

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.570
A drawing by Alone...

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:49.910
I will never forgive...
I will never forgive Hades!

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:54.420
He's returned.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:58.510
I'll have to keep our promise and meet you,
now that you've become a Saint.

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:01.470
I finally found it...

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.300
The perfect red for you.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.480
I should go see you.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:18.440
I have to finish your portrait.
As promised, two years ago...

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.400
Why... Why?

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:25.310
This is our hometown...

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:28.650
Tenma, are you all right?

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:29.790
No...

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:33.970
I won't ever forgive that bastard Hades!

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:35.710
Wh-What?

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.330
Yato! What happened?

00:11:49.240 --> 00:11:50.810
A Specter...

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:52.520
And him...

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.640
And Hades...

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.240
N-No...

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:11.530
Welcome back, Tenma.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:15.130
No, Pegasus Tenma.

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.650
My friend.

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:24.810
Why?

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:26.930
You were such a kind person.

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:31.390
We were always together, just like brothers.

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:34.020
You are...

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.060
Hades?!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:49.150
Alone!

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:50.160
Tenma!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.250
I made them! Three matching bracelets!

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:59.590
You did a good job, Sasha.

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:03.630
Uh, I'm a boy. I can't wear this.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:04.800
You're stupid, Tenma!

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.720
I'll be going far away soon, you know.

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:15.930
So I put all my hopes and prayers
into making these,

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:18.190
so you won't forget me.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:22.940
So when we're all separated,

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.460
we'll be able to see each other again.

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:30.370
Right now, we're still really small.
And we can't just do anything we want.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.330
Don't cry, Sasha.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.380
We'll meet again.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:40.080
Yeah, Sasha.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:48.300
I'm sure these bracelets will bind us together.

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:49.990
I'm sure...

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.250
I'm sure.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.930
<i>What's the meaning of this?</i>

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:02.110
<i>That Hades chose this young boy's
body to reincarnate into...</i>

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:05.070
<i>Tenma's best friend, Alone?</i>

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:07.950
You're Hades.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.200
That's ridiculous.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.830
You couldn't have done all this to the town.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.700
It just isn't possible!

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.960
Say something, Alo...

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.780
You haven't changed at all, Tenma.

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.670
You're the same as you were two years ago.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:27.490
I'm happy...

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:31.430
<i>A-Alone...</i>

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:36.140
So you kept your promise and returned a Saint.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:43.260
I also became a great painter,
one who can save people with my paintings.

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:47.570
Do you remember this portrait?

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:52.450
That's the painting Alone did two years ago...

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:57.540
I promised to finish it,
once you'd returned as a Saint, right?

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:03.380
I'm finally able to make the red
that I couldn't back then.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.130
True red.

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:13.340
What? A sea of blood?
When did you...

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:14.800
Tenma!

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:17.770
<i>Alone! What is he thinking?</i>

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:38.400
Alone... You...

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:40.890
Why...

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:49.050
No... Tenma!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.730
You!

00:15:56.560 --> 00:16:00.480
<i>His golden hair is turning jet black...</i>

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.560
<i>Farewell, Tenma.</i>

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:08.900
<i>Farewell, Sasha.</i>

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.450
<i>Farewell...</i>

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.670
<i>Alone.</i>

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:15.430
Wait!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:22.120
Why did you kill Tenma, your best friend?

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.870
Answer me, Alone!

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.250
Because I learned...

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.250
Death is salvation!

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:32.560
Then I have no more mercy.

00:16:32.560 --> 00:16:36.340
If Tenma's best friend Alone no longer exists,

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:40.600
I'll take Tenma's enemy!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:46.600
What?

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:52.110
I can't allow you to hang
around Hades any longer.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:56.070
So says the Heavenly Savage Star, Bennu Kagaho.

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:57.700
Out of my way!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.490
<i>Lushan One Hundred Dragons Attack!</i>

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:02.470
Idiot. Take this!

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.580
Wind from the dark skies...

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.080
<i>Corona Blast!</i>

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:20.760
<i>That Cosmo... The bastard has
the power to match the Gold Saints?</i>

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.980
<i>But I won't give in!</i>

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:29.210
Why do you stop me, Shion?

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:30.690
Don't rush, Dohko!

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:33.250
We have a duty to fulfill.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:35.190
It's not yet time for a showdown.

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:37.870
The Pegasus and Unicorn Saints
have both been killed!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:38.780
I know!

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:41.910
I know. But...

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.590
But there's nothing we can do about it.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.870
What's happening?

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:48.830
What?

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.710
Yato! Tenma!

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:55.780
Stop.

00:18:01.800 --> 00:18:03.100
So you're running away?

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.730
It's fine, Kagaho.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:09.260
We have accomplished our initial objectives.

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:11.610
Don't start unnecessary fights.

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.570
The town has perished.

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.650
My best friend has perished.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.790
The end of the human known as Alone.

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:26.780
After all, the Holy War has only just begun.

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:34.210
Have they gathered?

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.980
The Demon Stars?

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:43.950
Now Lord Hades has been
completely resurrected.

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:50.100
My troops. My Specters.

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:52.810
Look on...

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:58.010
It's a starry sky on the ceiling...

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:59.800
No, these are

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.320
constellations.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:07.060
As you know, each Saint has
their own Guardian Constellation

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:09.960
and wears the Cloth designed for them.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:13.210
In other words,
these give the Saints their lives.

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:16.170
Should parts of the constellations
fall to darkness...

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:18.300
The constellation is gone?

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.000
That was Pegasus.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:24.810
He was destroyed by Lord Hades himself.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.930
My Specters...

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:32.630
When every color of this world mixes,
they create black.

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:35.900
That is the color of sweet salvation.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:42.740
Everyone, will you paint this sky and
the Earth that color for me?

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:48.060
Take the lives of the Saints... Nay, of Athena.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:51.520
And paint this world a peaceful black.

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:56.930
First, we must destroy the Sanctuary.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:59.510
Griffin Minos, the Heavenly Noble Star.

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:03.570
Gather your men and head for the Sanctuary.

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:05.090
Yes, my lady.

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:08.070
We'll show the Saints the true power

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:12.550
possessed by the mightiest of
the 108 Demon Stars,

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:15.310
demonstrated by one of our three leaders.

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:27.360
I, Minos, promise to present Lord Hades
with the finest black.

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:38.570
You didn't reveal yourself to me before,
so where were you,

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:39.760
Kagaho?

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:45.340
I am uncomfortable in those kinds of situations.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:48.080
That sounds like you.

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:52.910
So what is it that you want, Kagaho?

00:20:52.910 --> 00:20:55.310
There is something I would like to confirm.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:58.520
Will you lift up your right sleeve?

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:07.600
Kagaho?

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.800
Did he get that

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.960
from the impact of Dohko's
Lushan One Hundred Dragons Attack?

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:20.610
I won't let you get away with it, Libra Dohko...

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:30.350
Minos and the others have flown to the Sanctuary.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:32.570
To the Sanctuary...

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:51.100
Where is the battle?

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.030
Dohko? Hades?

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.000
What...

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:03.300
<i>That sinister-looking shrine...</i>

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.340
<i>It has to be...</i>

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:06.530
<i>Hades!</i>

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:13.060
Oh, no. It can't be.

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:14.430
Te...

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:18.310
Tenma, how could you have died?

00:22:18.970 --> 00:22:21.810
Wake up, Tenma! Tenma!

00:22:21.810 --> 00:22:23.310
Tenma!

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:28.160
So there's a survivor.

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:07.210
Dear Alone, I think fondly of our days spent together.

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:10.570
Do you remember our promise under the tree?

00:24:11.020 --> 00:24:12.820
Maybe you forgot.

00:24:13.660 --> 00:24:16.930
What does my brother think?

00:24:17.390 --> 00:24:22.250
This may be my last ever letter to you.

00:24:23.570 --> 00:24:27.070
